Written 15 October 2026. Scope asked by Matthieu: speed, no design regression, no data bug, Assets and Create fluid,
Freelance automated, hub coherent. All of it is on `origin/main` and deployed; every change has a test.
The details of each fault are rows of `INDEX-ERREURS-FEATURES.md` dated 2026-10-15.

## What changed, by product

| Product | Change | Where | Measured effect |
|---|---|---|---|
| Assets (service) | Memoised file lists, coalesced state saves, coalesced automatic backups (240 s), yield to interactive actions, parallel snapshots | `scripts/AssetsService.mjs`, `scripts/AssetsConfig.json` | the "loader is busy" state is gone: bridge answers in ~110 ms during a pass |
| Assets (publication) | One Git transaction per publication (3 saves + 9 fetches become 1 fetch + 1 push); unchanged index not rewritten; no-op passes skip republication for 6 h | `scripts/AssetsCloudGitWriter.mjs`, `AssetsCloudPublisher.mjs` | 26-30 s of Git per pass down to one push |
| Assets (batches) | Batches of 2 000 files / 512 MiB; the engine pays about 35 s fixed per batch; 4 batches per pass | `AssetsConfig.json` | Japanese corpus: 51 309 pending files down to 0 |
| Assets (card lookup) | Table instead of a linear normalised search per file | `AssetsService.mjs` (`cardsByRel`) | 25 s freeze per batch removed |
| Assets (snapshot) | Three unread fields dropped (-29 %), failed metadata publication no longer an error loop, warning at 90 Mo | `AssetsService.mjs` | Japanese snapshot 104.7 MB (refused by GitHub) down to 80.8 MB |
| Assets (UI) | An automatic pass no longer disables the save button | `src/components/assets/*` | - |
| Index / search | Refresh reads only the first bytes of the 22 MB delta and reuses decrypted shards | `src/search/searchIndexClient.js` | no 22 MB download per view change |
| Create | Tree poll skips download parsing when the ETag is unchanged; visibility markers kept 10 min and never cache a failed read | `src/capture/folderVisibility.js` | 20 000-item folder: first tiles in 250 ms |
| Hub | One Cmd/Ctrl+K palette at the app root; "open in Create" links work from every view (mailbox `poserDemandePages`); a project opens its cloud folder | `src/App.jsx`, `src/create/Pages.jsx`, `src/components/SpotlightSearch.jsx` | - |
| Freelance | The whole batch (3/5/10/20/50) opens as tabs through the local service, one letter copied per card, a batch recorded in one confirmed click; groups draw 72 cards then page; deterministic day batch | `src/components/freelance/FreelanceBatch.jsx`, `src/lib/freelanceBatch.js`, `scripts/Freelance/Service.mjs` | 10 000 DOM nodes before, 72 cards now |
| Gallery | Text filter that only changes what is drawn; lightbox closes with Escape, steps with arrows, shows its position | `src/components/GalleryView.jsx` | - |
| Films | Subtitles, proof and unload of a streaming batch run 4 films at a time (`ZR_FINISH_FLOWS`) | `scripts/Films/ProcessFilmsSequentially.py` | - |
| Delivery | `Ship.sh` rebuilds the main checkout `dist/` after each delivery | atelier `Scripts/Ship.sh` | local :3100 no longer serves an old build |

